c:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed","children":"The VJ tradition started in Ugandan video halls in the 1980s and 1990s. Today, VJs like VJ Junior, Omutaka Ice P, VJ Jingo, VJ Emmy, and many others are cultural icons with massive followings. Their translated content is how millions of Ugandans experience cinema."}]
